\newlabel{fig:scholarship_coverage_matrix}{{50}{52}{Scholarship coverage by source role and manuscript track. The binary colorbar encodes whether a source supports a track, separating primary recapitulation, implementation anchors, background theory, proxy context, and limitations so citation density cannot launder unsupported claims}{figure.caption.55}{}}
